{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Their wine is the venom of serpents.</b> As its Targum renders: ״הָא כְמָרַת תַּנִּינַיָּא כֹּס פּוּרְעֲנוּתְהוֹן״ — behold, like the bitterness of serpents is the cup of the punishment of their drink." "<b>And the cruel venom of asps.</b> Their cup, which is cruel to the bitten — a cruel enemy will come and exact punishment from them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:26.622632494Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}